HwjBOWS3KXiUTU1kNTcOoMg&oe=6A4E4684"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Controls and Wiring", "keywords": ["control", "wiring", "vr", "immerselearn"], "long_description": "Controls and Wiring is an immersive VR training application that enables learners to develop real-world skills in electrical control systems, circuit wiring, and component integration. Through interactive simulations, users practice identifying components, interpreting wiring diagrams, assembling control circuits, and troubleshooting faults in a safe, virtual environment.\n\nThis application is a core component of the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, designed to enhance technical proficiency through experiential learning. Learners gain confidence by performing tasks that mirror real industry scenarios, improving both accuracy and decision-making skills.\n\nPlease note: This app is not a standalone product. Access is strictly limited to individuals enrolled in the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, where it is used for guided, hands-on training.", "short_description": "Controls and Wiring is a VR training application designed to build practical skills in electrical control systems and wiring. Part of the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, this app provides hands-on, immersive learning experiences. Access is exclusively available to learners enrolled in the program."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_a